                    <description>Radar estimate (unconfirmed) - Radar estimate (MESH). Held – radar only, 0 bldgs inside. HELD - radar only (MRMS MESH_Max_1440min 12:30Z 11/12): 2.0-2.1" in ~5 cells (1.75-2.0" neighbors) near 38.20N 88.12W, White Co. (Carmi/Crossville) IL; ground reports only dime-quarter (&lt;=0.25-1") hail (SPC 2211Z 2 NE Crossville, quarter-inch+); 0 C/I buildings &gt;=10k SF inside or within 1 mi; the nearest 10k SF+ buildings (~4 mi W near Carmi) are agriculture/residential/unclassified, so no leads. IL = license pending (No).</description>
