                <name>Waverly Public Schools - Waverly Intermediate School roof coating (ITB) (Waverly, NE)</name>
                <description>Bid Requests | has contact: Yes
NEW this report
seeking roofer (public bid - school roof coating) | Open public bid | 2026-11-12 (published; NoticeRegistry "Published Nov 12, 2026") | sealed bids due Mon 12/28/2026 3:00 PM; award expected 1/4/2027
Sealed bids invited to restore the existing modified-bitumen roof at Waverly Intermediate School with an approved coating system. Three copies to Waverly Public Schools, 14511 Heywood St, Waverly NE 68462 by 12/28/2026 3:00 PM; board expects to award 1/4/2027. District board had listed the Intermediate roof as a 2026-27 priority (June 2026). Commercial/public low-slope coating job ~50 mi from Omaha.
Contact: Mikal Shalikow, Business Manager
Phone: 402-786-2321 ext 1104
Email: mikal.shalikow@district145.org
Can solicit: Yes (Licensed/registered)
Armour is licensed or registered here (general info, not legal advice)
Website: https://www.district145.org
Confidence: high (notice + district site confirm)
Source: https://www.noticeregistry.com/nebraska/notice/bid-notice-waverly-779078
~39 mi from Omaha</description>
