Sealed bids from firms PREQUALIFIED under RFQ2026-083 for roof replacement and repairs at the District Administration Building, 40 Orange St, St. Augustine FL 32084. Mandatory pre-bid 11/19 9:00 AM at the site; 5% bid security; final addendum 12/8; deliver to Facilities &amp; Operations, 3740 International Golf Pkwy Ste 200. Only prequalified roofers can bid - confirm Armour prequalification status.
